{"id":"9a99af606e3a5e06","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/080_嵌套相继式演算_Nested_Sequents.md","title":"080 嵌套相继式演算 Nested Sequents","display":"080_嵌套相继式演算_Nested_Sequents","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-模态公式语言\">1. 模态公式语言</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"atm,\\quad neg,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad box,\\quad dia.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[atm,\\quad neg,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad box,\\quad dia.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_N\">\\(Frm_N\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\\in Frm_N\">\\(atm(p)\\in Frm_N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_N\">\\(A\\in Frm_N\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_N\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_N\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_N\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in Frm_N\">\\(and(A,B)\\in Frm_N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_N\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_N\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_N\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_N\">\\(A\\in Frm_N\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"box(A)\\in Frm_N\">\\(box(A)\\in Frm_N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_N\">\\(A\\in Frm_N\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dia(A)\\in Frm_N\">\\(dia(A)\\in Frm_N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本系统的目标差异为：结构对象是可嵌套的相继式树，模态规则通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"nest(seq(\\cdots))\">\\(nest(seq(\\cdots))\\)</span> 的局部深处重写表达，而不使用标号关系原子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式操作\">2. 公式操作</h1>\n<p>变元函数由下列方程给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV(neg(A))=PV(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV(neg(A))=PV(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\quad\nPV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\quad\nPV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(box(A))=PV(A),\\qquad PV(dia(A))=PV(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(box(A))=PV(A),\\qquad PV(dia(A))=PV(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_N=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_N=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_N\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_N\\)</span> 的扩张满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(neg(A))=neg(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(neg(A))=neg(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(box(A))=box(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(dia(A))=dia(\\widehat\\sigma(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(box(A))=box(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(dia(A))=dia(\\widehat\\sigma(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-嵌套相继式形成\">3. 嵌套相继式形成</h1>\n<p>嵌套项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NItem\">\\(NItem\\)</span> 与嵌套相继式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NSeq\">\\(NSeq\\)</span> 同时定义为最小集合，满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_N\">\\(A\\in Frm_N\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"form(A)\\in NItem\">\\(form(A)\\in NItem\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in NSeq\">\\(S\\in NSeq\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"nest(S)\\in NItem\">\\(nest(S)\\in NItem\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NItem\">\\(NItem\\)</span> 的有限多重集，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"seq(X)\\in NSeq\">\\(seq(X)\\in NSeq\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"form(A)\">\\(form(A)\\)</span>，写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[S]\">\\([S]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"nest(S)\">\\(nest(S)\\)</span>。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(NItem)\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(NItem)\\)</span> 是所有有限支持函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NItem\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(NItem\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，多重集相等逐点比较，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 逐点相加；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{I_0,\\ldots,I_{k-1}\\}\">\\(\\{I_0,\\ldots,I_{k-1}\\}\\)</span> 表示每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的重数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\{j&lt;k:I_j=I\\}|\">\\(|\\{j&lt;k:I_j=I\\}|\\)</span> 的多重集。上下文中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"nest(C)\">\\(nest(C)\\)</span> 是含一个相继式洞的模板构造，只有填洞后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"nest(Plug(C,S))\">\\(nest(Plug(C,S))\\)</span> 才属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NItem\">\\(NItem\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PV:Frm_N\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Prop)\">\\(PV:Frm_N\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Prop)\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:Frm_N\\to Frm_N\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:Frm_N\\to Frm_N\\)</span> 由第 2 节的六个构造递归唯一确定。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-嵌套上下文与填洞\">4. 嵌套上下文与填洞</h1>\n<p>洞符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_h\">\\(\\Box_h\\)</span>，不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NItem\">\\(NItem\\)</span>。单洞嵌套相继式上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NCtx\">\\(NCtx\\)</span> 是最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_h\\in NCtx\">\\(\\Box_h\\in NCtx\\)</span>，其洞类型是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NSeq\">\\(NSeq\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in NCtx\">\\(C\\in NCtx\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NItem\">\\(NItem\\)</span> 的有限多重集，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"seq(X+\\{nest(C)\\})\\in NCtx\">\\(seq(X+\\{nest(C)\\})\\in NCtx\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填洞函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Plug:NCtx\\times NSeq\\to NSeq\">\\(Plug:NCtx\\times NSeq\\to NSeq\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug(\\Box_h,S)=S,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug(\\Box_h,S)=S,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由递归子句</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug(seq(X+\\{nest(C)\\}),S)=seq(X+\\{nest(Plug(C,S))\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug(seq(X+\\{nest(C)\\}),S)=seq(X+\\{nest(Plug(C,S))\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换唯一洞。由此上下文洞始终装入一个嵌套相继式，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"nest\">\\(nest\\)</span> 构造把它转回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NItem\">\\(NItem\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NCtx\">\\(NCtx\\)</span> 不再被当作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NItem\">\\(NItem\\)</span> 的成员。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-初始与命题规则\">5. 初始与命题规则</h1>\n<p>初始集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_N\n=\n\\{Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(atm(p)),form(neg(atm(p)))\\})):\nC\\in NCtx,\\ p\\in Prop,\\ X\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(NItem)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_N\n=\n\\{Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(atm(p)),form(neg(atm(p)))\\})):\nC\\in NCtx,\\ p\\in Prop,\\ X\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(NItem)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_N=Init_N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_N=Init_N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(A)\\})),Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(B)\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(and(A,B))\\})))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(A)\\})),Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(B)\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(and(A,B))\\})))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(A),form(B)\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(or(A,B))\\})))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(A),form(B)\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(or(A,B))\\})))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>否定传播规则把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(neg(A))\">\\(neg(neg(A))\\)</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg\\neg}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(A)\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(neg(A)))\\})))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg\\neg}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(A)\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(neg(A)))\\})))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>De Morgan 规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg\\wedge}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(A)),form(neg(B))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(and(A,B)))\\})))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg\\wedge}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(A)),form(neg(B))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(and(A,B)))\\})))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg\\vee}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(A))\\})),Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(B))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(or(A,B)))\\})))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg\\vee}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(A))\\})),Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(B))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(or(A,B)))\\})))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模态对偶的否定规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg\\Box}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(dia(neg(A)))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(box(A)))\\})))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg\\Box}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(dia(neg(A)))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(box(A)))\\})))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\neg\\Diamond}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(box(neg(A)))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(dia(A)))\\})))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\neg\\Diamond}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(box(neg(A)))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(neg(dia(A)))\\})))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-模态嵌套规则\">6. 模态嵌套规则</h1>\n<p>盒规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\Box}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{nest(seq(Y+\\{form(A)\\}))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(box(A)),nest(seq(Y))\\})))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\Box}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{nest(seq(Y+\\{form(A)\\}))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(box(A)),nest(seq(Y))\\})))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>菱形规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\Diamond}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(dia(A)),nest(seq(Y+\\{form(A)\\}))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(dia(A)),nest(seq(Y))\\})))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\Diamond}^{N}\n=\n\\{((Plug(C,seq(X+\\{form(dia(A)),nest(seq(Y+\\{form(A)\\}))\\}))),\nPlug(C,seq(X+\\{form(dia(A)),nest(seq(Y))\\})))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以上每个规则集合均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NSeq^{&lt;\\omega}\\times NSeq\">\\(NSeq^{&lt;\\omega}\\times NSeq\\)</span> 的子集，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_N\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in NCtx\">\\(C\\in NCtx\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(NItem)\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(NItem)\\)</span>。定义总规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_N=\nRule_{\\wedge}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\vee}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\neg}^{N}\n\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\wedge}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\vee}^{N}\n\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\Box}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\Diamond}^{N}\n\\cup Rule_{\\Box}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\Diamond}^{N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_N=\nRule_{\\wedge}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\vee}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\neg}^{N}\n\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\wedge}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\vee}^{N}\n\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\Box}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\neg\\Diamond}^{N}\n\\cup Rule_{\\Box}^{N}\\cup Rule_{\\Diamond}^{N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-嵌套推导树\">7. 嵌套推导树</h1>\n<p>嵌套推导树由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_{N}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{N}\">\\(\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{N}\\)</span> 刻画。</p>\n<p>定义有限路径、根树、子节点和叶节点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N_0,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N_0\\times N_0\\land r\\in N_0\n\\land \\forall n\\in N_0\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N_0,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N_0\\times N_0\\land r\\in N_0\n\\land \\forall n\\in N_0\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN_0\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N_0\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N_0,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N_0\\to NSeq.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tree}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN_0\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N_0\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N_0,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N_0\\to NSeq.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在有限树域上，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prem_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\">\\(Prem_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\\)</span>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_n:k_n\\to\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)\">\\(e_n:k_n\\to\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)\\)</span> 为严格递增的唯一双射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_n=|\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)|\">\\(k_n=|\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)|\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prem_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n):k_n\\to\\operatorname{rng}(\\lambda)\">\\(Prem_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n):k_n\\to\\operatorname{rng}(\\lambda)\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(e_n(i))\">\\(\\lambda(e_n(i))\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in N_0\\land\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Ax_N)\n\\lor(Prem_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_N\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in N_0\\land\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Ax_N)\n\\lor(Prem_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_N\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>实际前提列覆盖全部不同子节点；一元、二元规则按该列的真实长度核验，不能重复一个节点冒充两个分支。各投影和该前提列函数仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_{N}\\)</span> 的域上调用。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N_0\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Der}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N_0\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{N}(N_0,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_N S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N_0\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=S\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_N S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N_0\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=S\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootLab}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{N}=\\{S\\in NSeq:\\vdash_N S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootLab}_{N}(N_0,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{N}=\\{S\\in NSeq:\\vdash_N S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{N}=(NItem,NSeq,NCtx,Plug,Rule_N,\\operatorname{Der}_{N},\\mathsf{Cn}_{N}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{N}=(NItem,NSeq,NCtx,Plug,Rule_N,\\operatorname{Der}_{N},\\mathsf{Cn}_{N}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{NestedSequents}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_N,\nPV,\nSub_N,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nNItem,\nNSeq,\nNCtx,\nPlug,\nInit_N,\nAx_N,\nRule_{\\wedge}^{N},\nRule_{\\vee}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\neg}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\wedge}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\vee}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\Box}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\Diamond}^{N},\nRule_{\\Box}^{N},\nRule_{\\Diamond}^{N},\nRule_N,\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{N},\nPrem_{N},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{N},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{N},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{N},\n\\vdash_N,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{N},\n\\Delta_{N}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{NestedSequents}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_N,\nPV,\nSub_N,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nNItem,\nNSeq,\nNCtx,\nPlug,\nInit_N,\nAx_N,\nRule_{\\wedge}^{N},\nRule_{\\vee}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\neg}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\wedge}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\vee}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\Box}^{N},\nRule_{\\neg\\Diamond}^{N},\nRule_{\\Box}^{N},\nRule_{\\Diamond}^{N},\nRule_N,\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{N},\nPrem_{N},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{N},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{N},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{N},\n\\vdash_N,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{N},\n\\Delta_{N}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含嵌套相继式树、单洞上下文、深层命题规则和盒/菱形嵌套规则；不含标号关系原子、超相继式外部结构或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-模态公式语言","text":"1. 模态公式语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式操作","text":"2. 公式操作","level":1},{"id":"3.-嵌套相继式形成","text":"3. 嵌套相继式形成","level":1},{"id":"4.-嵌套上下文与填洞","text":"4. 嵌套上下文与填洞","level":1},{"id":"5.-初始与命题规则","text":"5. 初始与命题规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-模态嵌套规则","text":"6. 模态嵌套规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-嵌套推导树","text":"7. 嵌套推导树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"atm,\\quad neg,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad box,\\quad dia.","display":true},{"tex":"Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Prop","display":false},{"tex":"atm(p)\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"neg(A)\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"and(A,B)\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"or(A,B)\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"box(A)\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"dia(A)\\in Frm_N","display":false},{"tex":"nest(seq(\\cdots))","display":false},{"tex":"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV(neg(A))=PV(A),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\quad\nPV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(box(A))=PV(A),\\qquad PV(dia(A))=PV(A).","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_N=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in Sub_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\w